Ima: Mayap a abak, anak! Did you sleep well?
[signal arg="[signal arg="encounter_mayap_a_abak"]"]
You: Mayap a abak, Ima!
[signal arg="[signal arg="learn_mayap_a_abak"]"]
Litik: Look at that! Yesterday, you could barely get the words out. Now you're greeting Ima all by yourself.
You: I suppose the practice is helping.
Ima: It certainly seems so. Keep practicing, and don't lose heart.
Ima: Chief said he'll finish your training today. He's waiting near the forest entrance.
You: Then I should get going.
Ima: Be careful, anak. And don't forget what you've learned.
You: I won't. I'll see you later, Ima.
Ima: Take care.
[signal arg="[signal arg="set_flag_final_training_unlocked"]"]
[end_timeline]
